      "value": "@{60196b3fe67ad0337acea448|full_name}: I'm on green and blue status almost all of the time. I'm sometimes generous with friend requests too, but I will sometimes have moments where someone that I recently added (but don't know too well) will join my close friend group and embarrass me or themself. Then I have to attempt to casually say the sentence \"They're my friend\".",
