  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-29T19:04:47.856Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Your friends might be in Ask Me (orange) status for various reasons. An example is that they're picky with who joins them, and being on orange can deter friends from sending them requests to join.\nI request that when you add someone, it sets them as an Acquaintance. You have them added as a contact, but they must request to join you, even if you're on Online (green) status, for Public, Friends+, Friends worlds. However, you can graduate Acquaintances to a Friend at any time, or vice-versa.\nFor those who are an acquaintance, it gives them a goal to know your contact better. On the bright side, if the contact is on green, they will be more likely to request to join, versus on orange.",
